.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Iterates the quadratic map z \mapsto z^2 + c from every starting point z_0 of a grid. Points whose orbits stay bounded form the filled Julia set; its boundary, the Julia set, separates the Fatou set, where nearby orbits behave alike, from the region where orbits escape to infinity. Changing c turns the Julia set from a circle into a fractal curve or a disconnected dust.">

.. only:: html

  .. image:: /api/gallery/fractals_chaos/mandelbrot_julia/images/thumb/sphx_glr_plot_01_julia_sets_thumb.png
