.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Colours every parameter c by how quickly the orbit of z_0 = 0 under z \mapsto z^2 + c escapes. The black region, the Mandelbrot set, is the set of c whose orbit stays bounded -- equivalently, whose Julia set is connected. Zooming into its boundary reveals ever finer detail, including small copies of the whole set.">

